OL,3,GNEWSADoctor 'enraged' over NHS
OL,4,Atransgender ward policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA row has erupted over NHS policies
OL,7,Fwhich allow transgender women onto
OL,8,Fwomen-only wards.
OL,10,FA consultant psychiatrist at Greater
OL,11,FManchester Mental Health NHS Foundation
OL,12,FTrust (GMMH) claims a patient, who
OL,13,Fidentified as a trans woman, exposed
OL,14,Fthemselves to female patients during
OL,15,Ftheir stay.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Mental Health NHS
OL,18,FFoundation Trust (GMMH) said it had
OL,19,Finvestigated the allegations and had no
OL,20,Frecord of this ever happening.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
