OL,3,GNEWSADoctor 'enraged' over NHS
OL,4,Atransgender ward policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case highlights the fact that the
OL,7,FNHS still has no national policy
OL,8,Freflecting legal changes which say
OL,9,Fsingle-sex services must reflect
OL,10,Fbiological sex.
